  "description": "<h3>Description</h3>\n<p><span>Five generations in and the legacy of unstoppable comfort continues. We kept the beloved 35 mm x 30 mm stack height but tweaked the ZipFoam™ midsole to bring you a new design while keeping the plush, responsive ride Ultraventure is known for. From trail, to gravel, to road, the trusted Vibram® XS Trek outsole features an intentional lug pattern and depth built for optimal all-terrain performance. The mesh upper delivers our signature fit with increased durability, now updated with our universal gaiter system.</span></p>\n<ul></ul>\n<h3>\n<span>Specifications</span><span></span>\n</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Weight: 285.5g</span></li>\n<li><span>Heel to Toe Drop: 5mm</span></li>\n<li><span>Stack Height :35mm (Heel) x 3omm (Forefoot) </span></li>\n<li class=\"item-spec-gaiter\">\n<span class=\"item-spec-label\">Gaiter Compatible:</span><span class=\"item-spec-value\"> Yes</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"item-spec-rockplate\">\n<span class=\"item-spec-label\">Rock Plate:</span><span class=\"item-spec-value\"> No</span>\n</li>\n<li><span>Cushion: High</span></li>\n<li><span>Underfoot Feel: Plush</span></li>\n<li><span>Support: Neutral</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"RichContent-Html-Root MuiBox-root css-fynu7n\"></div>\n<ul></ul>",
